    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8629" root="حقف" body-key="H">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقَفَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَقُفَ</span></b> , inf.n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُقُوفٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (a thing)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, curved, bent,</i> or <i>winding.</i> (Msb.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُقُوفٌ</span> also signifies A gazelle's <i>being in the
condition denoted by</i> [<i>the part. n.</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاقِفٌ</span> <i>in the
phrase</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَبْىٌ حَاقِفٌ</span>, which see below. (Ibn-
'Abbád, K.)

